  "overview": "There is something very ominous about this mansion. Apparitions, faceless voices and Tarot cards hold the key to the mansion's mysteries. What took place here? What happened to the people that lived here? Only you can uncover the truth... if you dare!\n\n- What is fact? What is fiction? The truth may lie in the cards.\n- Roam the rooms of the seemingly deserted mansion searching for clues to the past.\n- Don't let the apparitions frighten you. They need your help...and you need theirs."
